  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "VRChat should implement an API to expose users' language preferences. Currently, events like Vket determine the language to display based on whether the user is in the UTC+9 timezone. This approach forces users like me, who live outside Japan but prefer to see content in Japanese, to manually switch the language setting every time I enter their world. Moreover, I occasionally encounter bugs related to this behavior. An API that allows developers to retrieve users' language preferences directly would streamline these processes and ensure the correct language is displayed consistently.",
